[agent] ## Note on the interface
[agent] The SDK's `model_versions` namespace exposes no `create`/`finalize` — those UC MLflow operations had to be driven through `api_client.do()` against the raw REST endpoints (`/api/2.0/mlflow/unity-catalog/model-versions/{create,finalize,set-tag}`). The typed SDK surface is incomplete for UC model-version registration; it can only read/update/delete existing versions, not create them.
